### Create a note
POST http://localhost:8080/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Database Test",
  "content": "This note should persist"
}

###

### Get all notes
GET http://localhost:8080/notes

###

### Get note by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/notes/2

###

### Update note
PUT http://localhost:8080/notes/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Database Test",
  "content": "This note was updated successfully"
}

###

### Get updated note
GET http://localhost:8080/notes/2

###

### Delete note
DELETE http://localhost:8080/notes/2

###

### Confirm deleted note returns 404
GET http://localhost:8080/notes/2
